een mb-1 ms-1 items-end "><label for="«id»" class="text-gray-600 text-sm font-medium ">נושא האימייל</label></div><input id="«id»" class="h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-white focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 disabled:opacity-50 border-gray-200 focus:outline-primary px-2.5" required="" maxlength="120" value=""></div><div class="block"><div class="flex justify-between mb-1 ms-1 items-end "><label for="«id»" class="text-gray-600 text-sm font-medium ">תוכן האימייל</label></div><textarea id="«id»" class="h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-white focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 disabled:opacity-50 border-gray-200 focus:outline-primary min-h-24 p-2.5" required="" rows="8"></textarea></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-gray-500">הוספת פרטים:</span><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>שם הליד</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>שם העסק</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>שם הנציג</span></button></div><div><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>הוספת כפתור לאימייל</span></button></div></section></div><div class="border-b w-full my-0"></div><section class="grid gap-3"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">מתי לשלוח</h3><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85