ה</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>אחרי יום</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>אחרי 3 ימים</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>יום לפני המועד</span></button></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 ms-1">אפשר גם לתזמן ביחס למועד הפגישה.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 ms-1">שליחה מתוזמנת מתבצעת תוך מספר דקות מהמועד שנקבע</p></section><div class="border-b w-full my-0"></div><section class="grid gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">כך זה ייראה אצל רועי</h3><div class="border rounded-md bg-gray-50 p-4 grid gap-2"><div class="grid gap-2"><div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-lg rounded-ss-none bg-white border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2"><p class="text-sm text-gray-800 whitespace-pre-line">שלום רועי, נתראה מחר</p></div></div></div></section><div class="grid gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3 w-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-white size-4 " style="mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/floppy-disk.svg&quot;); -webkit-mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/floppy-disk.svg&quot;); mask-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center; -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-type: alpha;"></div><span>שמור שינויים</span></button></div></div></div>",
  "expired": "<p class="rounded-[10px] bg-[#f1f2f5] px-3.5 py-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-[#6b7a8d]">מצב תצפית. SocialCRM מתעדת מה היה נשלח, בלי לשלוח בפועל.</p><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[10px] bg-warning-bg px-3.5 py-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-warning-text" role="alert"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 bg-warning " style="mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/triangle-exclamation.svg&quot;); -webkit-mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/triangle-exclamation.svg&quot;); mask-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center; -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-type: alpha;"></div>שליחת אימיילים אינה מוגדרת עדיין. נדרשת בדיקה בהגדרות החשבון.</div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.75 rounded-full bg-error shadow-[0_0_0_3px_var(--color-error-bg)]"></span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">דורש טיפול</span></div><span class="text-[12.5px] text-[#b3bbc6]">עודכן לפני 3 ש׳</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><p class="text-[33px] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">12 פניות</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#8b98a8]">טופלו היום על ידי SocialCRM, בלי שנגעתם בהן.</p></div><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col gap-3.5"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between pb-0.5"><h2 class="text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#aab3c0]">האוטומציות שלי</h2><span class="text-[13px] text-[#c2c9d4]">2 פעילות · 1 טיוטות</span></div><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col overflow-y-auto"><div class="group/row -mx-3 flex items-center gap-3.5 rounded-[10px] px-3 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-[#f7f8fa]"><button type="button" class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-start disabled:pointer-events-none"><span class=